        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "驯兽师平民小刀400G",
      "type": "weapon-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "魔术师平民杖400G",
      "type": "weapon-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "◆装备正确武器类型即可就职对应职业，非必须装备平民武器",
      "type": "weapon-type-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "2.前往法兰城城东医院（221.83）与药剂师波洛姆（16.35）对话，购买1瓶【止痛药（特价品）】。",
      "type": "item-purchase",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆【止痛药（特价品）】：3G/瓶，不可交易",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "3.前往法兰城职业公会（73.60）与安布伦（10.6）对话，选“是”交出【止痛药（特价品）】获得【试炼洞穴通行证】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "4.前往法兰城西门外国营第24坑道（351.145）。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "持有【试炼洞穴通行证】与哈鲁迪亚（9.14）对话通过栅栏，至（9.5）处下楼进入试炼之洞窟。",
      "type": "held-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "◆持有【试炼洞穴通行证】与法拉米亚（7.5）对话，选“确定”交出【试炼洞穴通行证】并被传送至栅栏外",
      "type": "abort-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆试炼之洞窟：固定迷宫，共5层；魔物为Lv.3~5 大蝙蝠、火蜘蛛",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "试炼之洞窟，行走路线：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "5.通过迷宫抵达试炼之洞窟大厅，",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "⑴就职路线：装备对应武器，与波罗米亚（23.15）对话，交出【试炼洞穴通行证】，获得与武器相对应的【职业推荐信】。",
      "type": "employment-letter",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "⑵转职路线：不需装备对应武器，与亚伦（24.12）对话，输入相关职业名称（仅限本任务内包含的职业），",
      "type": "transfer-letter",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "交出【试炼洞穴通行证】，可获得相对应的【职业推荐信】",
      "type": "transfer-letter",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆若物品栏内已有本任务获得的某一职业的【职业推荐信】，则不可重复获得【职业推荐信】",
      "type": "duplicate-letter-block",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "6.返回法兰城与相关职业就职人员对话，就职成功，任务完结。",
      "type": "career-completion",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
